{"id": "g1-001", "domain": "CI pipeline", "names": ["Start", "Process", "Check", "Done"], "groups": {}, "text": "okay so this is the build pipeline for our CI. Group Start, Process and Check as Pipeline please, they really belong together. Then move Pipeline 120 pixels to the left and add a green circle called Deploy right of Done. Is Done part of any group?", "wires": [{"span": "Group Start, Process and Check as Pipeline", "trigger": "Group", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Start,Process,Check", "name": "Pipeline"}}, {"span": "move Pipeline 120 pixels to the left", "trigger": "move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Pipeline", "direction": "left", "distance": "120"}}, {"span": "add a green circle called Deploy right of Done", "trigger": "add", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "green", "name": "Deploy", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Done"}}, {"span": "Is Done part of any group", "trigger": "part of", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Done"}}]}
